  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1223894,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 2 Hap in 1 - Moai-ui Bomul + David II: A Double Dose of Sega Fun!\n\nExperience two wildly different adventures in one cartridge with *2 Hap in 1* for the Sega Master System! First, dive into the vibrant world of *Moai-ui Bomul*, a charming puzzle-platformer. Guide Bomul, a lovable Moai statue, through a series of increasingly challenging levels, collecting gems and avoiding mischievous Tiki spirits. Master Bomul's unique abilities – rotating his body to navigate tricky terrain and using his stone strength to solve puzzles – to reach the ancient temple.\n\nThen, switch gears to *David II*, a fast-paced, action-packed side-scrolling shooter. Take control of David, a heroic warrior battling hordes of robotic enemies and monstrous bosses. Utilize a variety of powerful weapons, including lasers and missiles, to blast your way through futuristic landscapes. \n\n*2 Hap in 1* offers a unique and diverse gaming experience, blending puzzle-solving with intense action, all wrapped in the classic 8-bit charm of the Sega Master System. A perfect choice for players seeking variety and a nostalgic blast from the past!"
    },
